      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="DiagnosticsHint">
      <segment>
        <source>When something goes wrong, export a diagnostics package (zip) and send it to the developer. User names and the computer name are replaced; nothing is uploaded automatically.</source>
        <target state="translated">出現問題時匯出診斷包（zip）傳給開發者分析。使用者名稱和電腦名稱會被替換，不會自動上傳任何內容。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="DiagnosticsIncludeConfiguration">
      <segment>
        <source>Include rules and the app list (program paths, domains)</source>
        <target state="translated">包含規則和應用程式清單（程式路徑、網域）</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="DiagnosticsIncludeActivity">
      <segment>
        <source>Include the recent connection log (visited addresses and domains, last 7 days)</source>
        <target state="translated">包含最近的連線記錄（造訪過的位址和網域，最近 7 天）</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
