      <segment>
        <source>Export your rules to move them to another computer. Rules are also backed up automatically every day; the last 7 days are kept.</source>
        <target state="translated">匯出規則即可移轉到另一台電腦。規則每天自動備份，保留最近 7 天。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
